  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Tip Calculator</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Tip</h1>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"bill\">Bill amount ($)</label>\n      <input type=\"number\" id=\"bill\" min=\"0\" step=\"0.01\" value=\"0\" inputmode=\"decimal\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <span class=\"label\">Tip percent</span>\n      <div class=\"tip-buttons\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Tip percentage\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"tip-btn\" data-tip=\"10\" aria-pressed=\"false\">10%</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"tip-btn\" data-tip=\"15\" aria-pressed=\"false\">15%</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"tip-btn\" data-tip=\"20\" aria-pressed=\"false\">20%</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"people\">Number of people</label>\n      <input type=\"number\" id=\"people\" min=\"1\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" inputmode=\"numeric\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"results\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n      <div class=\"result-row\">\n        <span>Tip per person</span>\n        <span id=\"tip-per-person\">$0.00</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"result-row total\">\n        <span>Total per person</span>\n        <span id=\"total-per-person\">$0.00</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": "Main HTML structure with accessible form controls and result display."
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card: #16213e;\n  --accent: #e94560;\n  --text: #f0f0f0;\n  --muted: #a0a0b0;\n  --border: #0f3460;\n  --pressed: #c0354d;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  background-image: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--border) 25%, transparent 25%),\n    linear-gradient(-45deg, var(--border) 25%, transparent 25%),\n    linear-gradient(45deg, transparent 75%, var(--border) 75%),\n    linear-gradient(-45deg, transparent 75%, var(--border) 75%);\n  background-size: 20px 20px;\n  background-position: 0 0, 0 10px, 10px -10px, -10px 0;\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--border);\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--border);\n  padding: 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 400px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 20px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 28px;\n  text-align: center;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--border);\n}\n\n.field {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\nlabel, .label {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\ninput[type=\"number\"] {\n  font-size: 18px;\n  padding: 12px;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  color: var(--text);\n  font-family: inherit;\n  width: 100%;\n}\n\ninput[type=\"number\"]:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n.tip-buttons {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.tip-btn {\n  flex: 1;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  padding: 12px 0;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  color: var(--text);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-family: inherit;\n  transition: background 0.1s, transform 0.1s;\n}\n\n.tip-btn:hover {\n  background: var(--border);\n}\n\n.tip-btn:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n.tip-btn:active {\n  transform: translate(2px, 2px);\n}\n\n.tip-btn[aria-pressed=\"true\"] {\n  background: var(--accent);\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--bg);\n}\n\n.tip-btn[aria-pressed=\"true\"]:active {\n  background: var(--pressed);\n}\n\n.results {\n  background: var(--bg);\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  padding: 16px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.result-row {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--muted);\n}\n\n.result-row.total {\n  font-size: 20px;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.result-row span:last-child {\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 360px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 16px;\n    box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--border);\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 24px;\n  }\n}",
      "description": "Pixel-art themed styles with responsive layout and accessible focus states."
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "(function () {\n  'use strict';\n\n  var billInput = document.getElementById('bill');\n  var peopleInput = document.getElementById('people');\n  var tipButtons = document.querySelectorAll('.tip-btn');\n  var tipPerPersonEl = document.getElementById('tip-per-person');\n  var totalPerPersonEl = document.getElementById('total-per-person');\n\n  var tipPercent = 15;\n\n  function formatCurrency(value) {\n    return '$' + value.toFixed(2);\n  }\n\n  function calculate() {\n    var bill = parseFloat(billInput.value);\n    var people = parseInt(peopleInput.value, 10);\n\n    if (isNaN(bill) || bill < 0) bill = 0;\n    if (isNaN(people) || people < 1) people = 1;\n\n    var tip = bill * (tipPercent / 100);\n    var total = bill + tip;\n    var tipPerPerson = tip / people;\n    var totalPerPerson = total / people;\n\n    // Use epsilon to avoid floating-point rounding errors (e.g., 50.50 * 1.10 / 2)\n    tipPerPersonEl.textContent = formatCurrency(Math.round(tipPerPerson * 100 + 1e-9) / 100);\n    totalPerPersonEl.textContent = formatCurrency(Math.round(totalPerPerson * 100 + 1e-9) / 100);\n  }\n\n  function setTip(percent) {\n    tipPercent = percent;\n    tipButtons.forEach(function (btn) {\n      var isActive = parseInt(btn.dataset.tip, 10) === percent;\n      btn.setAttribute('aria-pressed', isActive ? 'true' : 'false');\n    });\n    calculate();\n  }\n\n  tipButtons.forEach(function (btn) {\n    btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n      setTip(parseInt(btn.dataset.tip, 10));\n    });\n  });\n\n  billInput.addEventListener('input', calculate);\n  peopleInput.addEventListener('input', calculate);\n\n  setTip(15);\n})();",
      "description": "Calculation logic with corrected rounding to fix floating-point precision."
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Tip Calculator\n\nA retro pixel-art themed tip calculator built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. Works fully offline in any modern browser.\n\n## Features\n\n- Enter bill amount and number of people\n- Choose tip percentage: 10%, 15%, or 20%\n- Instantly see tip per person and total per person\n- Keyboard accessible with labeled controls and visible focus states\n- Responsive layout down to 360px wide\n- No external assets, packages, or network requests\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in your browser.\n2. Enter the bill amount.\n3. Select a tip percentage button.\n4. Enter the number of people.\n5. Results update automatically.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — structure and content\n- `styles.css` — pixel-art theme and responsive layout\n- `script.js` — calculation logic and interactivity\n\n## Color Palette\n\n- Background: `#1a1a2e`\n- Card: `#16213e`\n- Accent: `#e94560`\n- Border: `#0f3460`\n- Text: `#f0f0f0`\n\n## Accessibility\n\n- All inputs have associated `<label>` elements.\n- Tip buttons use `aria-pressed` to indicate selection.\n- Results area uses `aria-live=\"polite\"` for screen reader announcements.\n- Focus outlines are visible on all interactive elements.\n\n## License\n\nMIT",
      "description": "Project documentation and usage instructions."
    }
  ]
}